WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.967
Describe the personal tool you want to create.

2
00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:11.967
Q-Brain generates the Python source. Waiting time shortened.

3
00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:15.933
Refine your request in the conversation.

4
00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:19.933
Read the proposed program before running it.

5
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:27.500
Review and edit the code: correct the Food addition.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.467
Check the file write, then explicitly approve execution.

7
00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:38.433
Real sandbox output: the correct total is 41.20 EUR.

8
00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:42.400
Execution passed. The reviewed source is preserved.

9
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:47.400
Add the verified code to Quantum Tools.

10
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:52.400
Open your saved tool in Action Forge.

11
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.367
Run the saved tool again from its test panel.

12
00:00:56.367 --> 00:01:01.333
Your reusable tool returns the same verified result.
